      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "i have had multiple avatars of mine turn up almost unusable after the update when in full-body. i don't use any hacks on and rigs, and i don't have the intact files for some of my older avatars to be able to go back and fix them, besides there are 300 of them.. one avatar that a noticed has very visible broken shoulders and elbows twist breakage on it is this one : avtr_c41e9dbb-8d12-4158-8aad-b97328e5cee0 . the avatar is 2.0 and i have seen that the broken parts are mostly local rendered and when someone else is in the avatar it looks \"almost\" normal. i really hope this will be fixed somehow, otherwise idk what to do with all of my avatars",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
