      "value": "@{5c55a5c79f36fb1db2235113|full_name}: If you're stating that they have flipped upside-down hips and extra leg bones, then those are expected to break and we don't support them.\nI can't offer explanation for the others at this time-- it appears that there are several different edge-cases of non-standard rigs that cause issues.\nDo you still have the original files for these with the issues?\nIf you do not, it will unfortunately be very difficult for us to track down the issues.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
