      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Blender uses the Z axis to look to the next joint, 3Ds Max uses the X axis and Maya uses the Y axis.  \nAll models made with Maya or 3ds max has this issue. \nI used the BiPed Rig in 3ds max, it has been a standard mocap rig for many years and is stated that it is supported Unity Humanoid Documentation. My SDK2 avatars break with full body tracking.",
      "viewerReactions": null
